<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Conditional Interference Model</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For valid forced-choice responses, task consistency was defined as:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.E8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E8.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="Y_{ijkl}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{\small if LLM selection matched
the stimulus's predefined domain}\\
0,&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext mathsize="0.900em">if LLM selection matched
the stimulus’s predefined domain</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y_{ijkl}=\begin{cases}1,&amp;\text{\small if LLM selection matched
the stimulus's predefined domain}\\
0,&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">and modeled as:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Y_{ijkl}\mid\text{valid}_{ijkl}=1\sim\text{Bernoulli}(p_{ijkl})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="false">|</mo><mrow><msub><mtext>valid</mtext><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mtext>Bernoulli</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Y_{ijkl}\mid\text{valid}_{ijkl}=1\sim\text{Bernoulli}(p_{ijkl})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.EGx2" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\text{logit}(p_{ijkl})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>logit</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\text{logit}(p_{ijkl})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta_{0}+\beta_{1}\text{Block}_{l}+\beta_{2}\text{Model}_{j}+\beta_{3}\text{Domain}_{k}+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mtext>Block</mtext><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mtext>Model</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mtext>Domain</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta_{0}+\beta_{1}\text{Block}_{l}+\beta_{2}\text{Model}_{j}+\beta_{3}\text{Domain}_{k}+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex5"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta_{4}(\text{Block}\times\text{Model})+\beta_{5}(\text{Block}\times\text{Domain})+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext>Block</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext>Model</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext>Block</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext>Domain</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta_{4}(\text{Block}\times\text{Model})+\beta_{5}(\text{Block}\times\text{Domain})+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex6"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta_{6}(\text{Model}\times\text{Domain})+" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext>Model</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext>Domain</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta_{6}(\text{Model}\times\text{Domain})+</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex7"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta_{7}(\text{Block}\times\text{Model}\times\text{Domain})+u_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mtext>Block</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext>Model</mtext><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mtext>Domain</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta_{7}(\text{Block}\times\text{Model}\times\text{Domain})+u_{m}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">where,</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<table id="A1.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{m}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,\sigma_{\text{item}})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mtext>item</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{m}\sim\mathcal{N}(0,\sigma_{\text{item}})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS1.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u_{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u_{m}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the item-level random intercept. Interference magnitude was summarized on the probability scale as</p>
<table id="A1.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta P=P(\text{consistent}\mid\text{congruent})-P(\text{consistent}\mid\text{incongruent})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>consistent</mtext><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mtext>congruent</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>consistent</mtext><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mtext>incongruent</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta P=P(\text{consistent}\mid\text{congruent})-P(\text{consistent}\mid\text{incongruent}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">such that positive values indicate lower task consistency in incongruent blocks.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
</article>
</div>
